    ],
    "speaker": "片头曲",
    "text": "毀我 好 毀我去毀我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0002",
    "t": [
      12.38,
      12.6
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "不去拖钉"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0003",
    "t": [
      90.3,
      93.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "神 真女人 就像"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0004",
    "t": [
      93.78,
      95.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "西施圈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0005",
    "t": [
      95.98,
      110.82
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "不是 不是 你知道嗎 這個拳類的目光 偷出了毒生一種胸光 唯一的眼神 偷露出那身 無限的溫柔 還滿 登訴的魅力"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0006",
    "t": [
      114.82,
      119.06
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "當然背後 也流露出那麼一點點胸膜"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0007",
    "t": [
      121.3,
      126.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你是不是還是不相信 我被關在電梯裡了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0008",
    "t": [
      126.3,
      129.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "無理取鬧的人 是什麼都不可能相信的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0009",
    "t": [
      129.3,
      136.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那是口誤 對了 那個小姐一時衝動 上來 一向 那也是口誤"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0010",
    "t": [
      136.3,
      142.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "那你先衝動 她就衝動 她就衝動 一向 你認識的人 怎麼對我這習慣"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0011",
    "t": [
      142.3,
      161.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "就純粹突發事件 我根本沒想到她會突然 一向 她就衝動 上來就罵了一向 衝動了 罵了一向 根本不是那個意思的 罵了一向 我是沒法被她罵了一向 我要早知道 她會衝動的上來 罵一向 我絕對不會讓她罵了一向 你明白了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0012",
    "t": [
      161.3,
      162.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "那"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0013",
    "t": [
      162.3,
      163.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "氣一下"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0014",
    "t": [
      167.3,
      168.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "什麼事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0015",
    "t": [
      168.3,
      173.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "一向 就是 就是吹口香糖"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0016",
    "t": [
      173.3,
      183.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "原來是吹口香糖 那爸爸肯定被人吹得一點 吐木心子 你說你當時沒反應過來"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0017",
    "t": [
      183.3,
      188.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "是啊 要不然我怎麼也會躲開嗎"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0018",
    "t": [
      188.3,
      193.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "躲開 誰信呢 迎著上吧你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0019",
    "t": [
      194.3,
      199.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你說你怎麼就不相信我呢 相信你 拿來"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0020",
    "t": [
      199.3,
      200.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "什麼呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0021",
    "t": [
      200.3,
      203.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "證據 這事上哪兒 拿證據去啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0022",
    "t": [
      203.3,
      206.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "沒證據啊 慣犯"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0023",
    "t": [
      206.3,
      208.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我憑什麼我就慣犯了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0024",
    "t": [
      208.3,
      210.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "那行 出犯"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0025",
    "t": [
      210.3,
      211.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我壓根沒犯"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0026",
    "t": [
      211.3,
      213.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "沒犯 證據"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0027",
    "t": [
      215.3,
      218.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "當時電梯裡 救我們兩個人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0028",
    "t": [
      218.3,
      220.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "兩個人是吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0029",
    "t": [
      222.3,
      224.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "那她不就是證人嗎"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0030",
    "t": [
      225.3,
      230.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "這事我能去把人叫來證明嗎 你這不是強人所難嗎你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0031",
    "t": [
      230.3,
      236.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "怎麼不難啊 心疼的呀 不敢嘛 你心理有鬼嘛"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0032",
    "t": [
      238.3,
      243.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "成 我活出去 我非把她給你找來 你給我三年時間"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0033",
    "t": [
      243.3,
      245.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "多少 三年"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0034",
    "t": [
      245.3,
      248.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "三天 三天 可惡"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0035",
    "t": [
      250.3,
      252.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "挺好 挺好"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0036",
    "t": [
      258.3,
      260.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你在到底沒來過她嗎 你要不要吹"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0037",
    "t": [
      260.3,
      262.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你要不要吹 吹"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0038",
    "t": [
      290.3,
      312.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 吹"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0039",
    "t": [
      312.3,
      321.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "吹 吹 吹 吹 吹 那個嘛 嗯 你怎麼還不走"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0040",
    "t": [
      322.3,
      324.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "說過我找人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0041",
    "t": [
      324.3,
      325.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "誰呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0042",
    "t": [
      325.3,
      327.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你女的 聽我經驗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0043",
    "t": [
      327.3,
      331.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "女的心跳軟 容易户弄是吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0044",
    "t": [
      331.3,
      333.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你什麼意思"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0045",
    "t": [
      333.3,
      340.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "你們跟這都兩偏了 每天都說找人 我看你是想騙人嘛"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0046",
    "t": [
      343.3,
      347.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你說你也不想想 就我找這樣像騙人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0047",
    "t": [
      348.3,
      352.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "現在騙得多 現在也沒寫在臉上"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0048",
    "t": [
      353.3,
      355.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我跟你沒話可說"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0049",
    "t": [
      355.3,
      363.3
    ],
    "speaker": "保安",
    "text": "我跟你也有話說 這塊地方 保安工作我負責 我希望你能馬上離開"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0050",
    "t": [
      366.3,
      368.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "行 行"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0051",
    "t": [
      381.3,
      388.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你有點吃冰淇淋了 教育 都吃六塊冰淇淋了 你怎麼還好"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0052",
    "t": [
      388.3,
      391.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我有什麼辦法 誰要爸媽吵架"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0053",
    "t": [
      391.3,
      394.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "爸媽吵架 吃冰淇淋 有什麼關係"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0054",
    "t": [
      394.3,
      401.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我煩的時候就喜歡吃東西 我真的是 吃冰淇淋的方法 來緩解痛苦"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0055",
    "t": [
      401.3,
      402.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "這學的尿論"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0056",
    "t": [
      402.3,
      408.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "女性週刊 我是借去拿冰淇淋的機會 瞭解爸媽的情況"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0057",
    "t": [
      408.3,
      410.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "那你兩個什麼情況"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0058",
    "t": [
      410.3,
      419.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "跟你說 我前三次去的時候 爸爸做的電視 前發他 你猜他們看的是 你猜他看的是什麼節目"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0059",
    "t": [
      419.3,
      420.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "什麼節目"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0060",
    "t": [
      420.3,
      422.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "養豬的節目"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0061",
    "t": [
      423.3,
      424.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "那媽媽呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0062",
    "t": [
      424.3,
      432.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "媽媽呢 我都不知道 她說晚飯就回我室了 我室有沒有冰淇淋 那我們就沒機會去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0063",
    "t": [
      434.3,
      435.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "林夕"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0064",
    "t": [
      435.3,
      436.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "那你們去看看"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0065",
    "t": [
      437.3,
      448.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你這不是把我玩火坑裡推的嗎 他們正在騎頭上 萬一他們要問 請我考試找你 那我不都死定了嘛 這比上班長的危險 我不去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0066",
    "t": [
      448.3,
      451.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "那咱們的想辦法 包含他們吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0067",
    "t": [
      451.3,
      452.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我去找找談談"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0068",
    "t": [
      452.3,
      453.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你談什麼呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0069",
    "t": [
      453.3,
      460.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我威脅他們 他們如果再不合好的話 我就吃一百 合而冰淇淋 自殺"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0070",
    "t": [
      461.3,
      463.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你又幹什麼錢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0071",
    "t": [
      463.3,
      471.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我威脅他們 如果他們 要是再不合好的話 我就玩一個月的電腦 我類似我自己 這麼厲害"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0072",
    "t": [
      471.3,
      477.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "小雨小雨 回來回來 我倒是想了一個 妙計 想不想聽"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0073",
    "t": [
      480.3,
      487.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "太棒了 我再去哪一個冰淇淋 順便 把白面給你通了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0074",
    "t": [
      492.3,
      508.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "本人男43歲 曾與一女人一起 被關在電梯裡 回家好 引起妻子的憤怒 所以想找到那個女人 來為我證明我清白 如果你看到了 請與我聯繫 怎麼樣小雨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0075",
    "t": [
      508.3,
      514.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我覺得這個 一定能幫爸爸 找到那個在他臉上吹泡泡糖 那個阿姨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0076",
    "t": [
      519.3,
      522.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我手上就放開 放開 我手上就往前照顧你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0077",
    "t": [
      524.3,
      524.56
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "賴光"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0078",
    "t": [
      530.16,
      531.7
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "T web"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0079",
    "t": [
      537.22,
      539.42
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你這種蛤不怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0080",
    "t": [
      539.42,
      542.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你知道我什麼呀 人家會這麼射擊的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0081",
    "t": [
      542.3,
      544.26
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "到底不是親生的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0082",
    "t": [
      544.26,
      548.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你那個真臭明 你一看就知道 我這兒是戒的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0083",
    "t": [
      548.3,
      550.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "地我是說你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0084",
    "t": [
      550.3,
      551.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我說我看怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0085",
    "t": [
      553.06,
      553.34
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "爸爸"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0086",
    "t": [
      553.34,
      558.54
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "爸爸都陷入决境了 我们再准备拯救他 和你呢 一点都不着急"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0087",
    "t": [
      558.54,
      560.06
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "功招急又没有了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0088",
    "t": [
      563.42,
      565.3
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "寻人起事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0089",
    "t": [
      565.3,
      569.9
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "姐姐说呀 要敷衍一万张 贴满全贝金城"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0090",
    "t": [
      573.42,
      574.86
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你看什么呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0091",
    "t": [
      574.86,
      576.18
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这主意够塑的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0092",
    "t": [
      576.82,
      578.54
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "我冲毕你没证明枪"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0093",
    "t": [
      578.54,
      584.5
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "谁说我没主意了 我的主意 你起码不会把成本的人给找来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0094",
    "t": [
      584.5,
      586.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你要什么主意啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0095",
    "t": [
      586.18,
      596.94
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我这个主意 只需要在爸爸被困在电梯里 听一张就OK了 我再按说了 你的学生其实 现在他不学人眼球了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0096",
    "t": [
      603.74,
      646.14
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "姑娘啊 我的好姑娘啊 我们相遇在黑灯下火的 电梯里 你一不留神 亲在了我的脸上 我如今生患举政 就是人气 林四千 我最想见的一个人 就是你 求求你啊 各联各联我吧 我就剩最后一口气了 是你夏东海 地址 家主幸福小区 妖礼三洞 妖礼妖石 请你与他的文字联系 谢谢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0097",
    "t": [
      646.14,
      651.82
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "刘星 我爸还怎么得罪你了 这么组织他"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0098",
    "t": [
      651.82,
      663.5
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这叫舍不得老爸 套不着狼 像你们那么说 我们家呢 是因为打架 才请您来做一下证人 谁还敢买啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0099",
    "t": [
      663.5,
      666.38
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "那也不用非得爸爸给说死呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0100",
    "t": [
      667.38,
      672.34
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你动动脑筋 好好想想 谁会取军一个要死的人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0101",
    "t": [
      672.34,
      675.42
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "谁 有那么点道理"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0102",
    "t": [
      687.42,
      688.54
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "来啦"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0103",
    "t": [
      690.86,
      693.22
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "要死啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0104",
    "t": [
      693.22,
      696.9
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "没找这证人 你要为罪自杀你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0105",
    "t": [
      696.9,
      706.5
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "有梦 是谁 在我们当地的电梯旁 贴了一张寻人起事 说我要死了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0106",
    "t": [
      706.5,
      710.7
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "那那肯定是个假兴闻"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0107",
    "t": [
      710.7,
      714.74
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "肯定寻人起事的属名 是我的儿子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0108",
    "t": [
      714.74,
      716.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "您可有两儿子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0109",
    "t": [
      716.78,
      722.94
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "对 但就那个歪屍的抽细线下来看 很像你的文风啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0110",
    "t": [
      723.94,
      727.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我不是只想帮你找证人吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0111",
    "t": [
      727.38,
      730.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我们当地都以为我成立了 至三五月会啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0112",
    "t": [
      730.18,
      733.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "老亲啊 怎么回事啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0113",
    "t": [
      733.38,
      747.1
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我写了个起事 说爸快音气了 只想见你 上次在电梯里见着那姑娘 我真不是想让你演气 我只想帮人找证人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0114",
    "t": [
      747.1,
      749.14
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你一点都不想陪下她了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0115",
    "t": [
      749.14,
      752.62
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "这是什么 行了 干嘛这个孩子这样啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0116",
    "t": [
      752.62,
      756.46
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我想对你这样 我敢问我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0117",
    "t": [
      756.46,
      767.26
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你们单位这些人也是 我犯你们文艺界头脑是简单 这能是真的吗 一看就是开玩笑的 也就是你们单位人系 这种走的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0118",
    "t": [
      767.26,
      772.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我这些天一直在找那女的 手机都没开 我们当地还不认为我真出事啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0119",
    "t": [
      772.98,
      774.74
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "谁啊 你不开手机的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0120",
    "t": [
      777.14,
      779.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你真是我的闲类住手"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0121",
    "t": [
      782.98,
      786.3
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "只算我又会取消了 下冬还不死了 什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0122",
    "t": [
      788.98,
      791.02
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "是你啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0123",
    "t": [
      791.02,
      792.98
    ],
    "speaker": "电话女声",
    "text": "你看见学生气势啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0124",
    "t": [
      792.98,
      795.94
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我没死 我真的没死"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0125",
    "t": [
      795.94,
      797.7
    ],
    "speaker": "电话女声",
    "text": "瞧你说的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0126",
    "t": [
      797.7,
      799.42
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "这个 我的这个"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0127",
    "t": [
      802.38,
      804.22
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "挺好的 真的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0128",
    "t": [
      806.62,
      840.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我最近真的有点生不如死 我听见听见 对对 特别希望跟你见面 有些话 我必须当面跟你说清楚 真的真的 没开玩笑 我要见不到你啊 我可能真的就死了 这样了 你能不能到我家来一趟 咱俩见个面 你关系没关系 我 我什么时候都行 多晚你都可以来 我等着你 那好的好的好的 再见再见 来 他几个来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0129",
    "t": [
      842.18,
      843.42
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "可是你刚才来的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0130",
    "t": [
      846.42,
      849.66
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "好显不可认识"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0131",
    "t": [
      853.26,
      854.46
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "马上就到了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0132",
    "t": [
      855.98,
      857.66
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "望眼余穿的你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0133",
    "t": [
      858.26,
      861.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那是 真相即将大白于天下"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0134",
    "t": [
      862.58,
      865.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你真相信他回来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0135",
    "t": [
      866.58,
      873.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那当然 因为他明白 一个人被误会 有多痛苦 所以他一定会来 虽然我没死"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0136",
    "t": [
      874.58,
      877.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你够了解他的你 当然了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0137",
    "t": [
      878.58,
      882.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你可别到哪一旁 这可是你逼着我 把真人找来的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0138",
    "t": [
      883.58,
      886.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "说一话 我哪知道你真的能 把他找来啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0139",
    "t": [
      888.58,
      891.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那你到底什么意思啊 你这是啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0140",
    "t": [
      891.58,
      898.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你说什么意思啊 你就从来都不了解我 我根本就没有不相信你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0141",
    "t": [
      899.58,
      901.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那你生那么大气干吗呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0142",
    "t": [
      902.58,
      912.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "废话人家喝着肚子 等着你一晚上 你那么晚他回来点 他还戴着口红眼 然后还说我无力取闹 我是无力取闹吗 你问问哪个女的 受得了啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0143",
    "t": [
      917.58,
      928.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那你怎么不相相我呢 我可是被关在那黑古龙东的垫梯里 整整你一晚上 经研究表明 被关在龙子里的狼 比放在外边的狼更容易发怒"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "022",
    "unit_id": "u0144",
    "t": [
